WEBVTT

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.380
Our guest today is the hip and happening

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:13.070
ultra-miracle super idol, Ieyasu-chan!

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:29.420
You're rather popular, aren't you?

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:31.160
Thank you.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:33.880
You've been doing all kinds of 
things this year, haven't you?

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:36.760
<b>Yellow Ribbon Awards Ceremony</b>

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:39.500
You won the Yellow Ribbon 
prize for Best New Actress,

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.130
and both your singles and 
albums have sold over

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:44.010
a million copies, earning you a gold disc.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:47.600
You even sold-out a concert at the Pablo Dome!

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:51.650
You really have had a busy year!

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:56.840
And now you're going to be the 
heroine of a hit new prime time series!

00:00:57.550 --> 00:01:01.640
You're truly the queen of idols!

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:40.630
<b>Kusamoe 
Yuru</b>

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:43.640
<b>Kusamoe Yuru
Sugimura Tatsuya-sama</b>

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:43.310
Come in.

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:45.340
Excuse me.

00:02:46.990 --> 00:02:49.020
Good morning, Sugimura-san.

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:53.290
Good morning, I'm Ieyasu!

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:56.200
Hello, Ieyasu-chan.

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:59.000
You're really popular, aren't you?

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:02.780
Stop that, Ieyasu.

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:05.440
We're honored, Sugimura-san.

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:08.600
I thought you could give her a few pointers.

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.900
Come on, Ieyasu.

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:12.750
I look forward to working with you!

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:16.980
I'm glad to be your co-star, as well.

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:18.800
Let's do this.

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:23.000
Goodbye.

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:26.780
I'm glad he seemed nice.

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:29.480
Don't be so relaxed.

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:32.340
He's a big actor,

00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:36.230
but you need to try and be even bigger.

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:37.780
That's impossible.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.110
It's not.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.120
<b>Kusamoe Yuru 
Tokugawa Ieyasu-sama</b>

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:57.650
What? Is something wrong?

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:01.720
When's my next vacation?

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:02.780
Vacation?

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:05.090
Not for a while, of course.

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:08.160
This is an important time.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:09.630
If you let your guard down here,

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:11.310
you won't be on top for long.

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:15.900
But... I think I'm running low on juice.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:17.690
I want to recharge.

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:20.000
Switch to solar.

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:23.890
My last manager said

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:26.710
I needed time to look at what I'm doing.

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:27.780
How stupid.

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:28.740
That's not true.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:32.300
Your job is to have other 
people look at you.

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:34.080
Don't forget that.

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:38.960
I'm going to go say 
hello to the producer.

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:42.030
You should head over to the studio.

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:56.150
Am I really okay like this?

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:18.830
<b>Kusamoe Yuru 
Tokugawa Ieyasu-sama</b>

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:16.580
Excuse me.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.830
I'm here to empty the trash.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:23.370
Is there anybody here?

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:38.880
What are you doing?

00:05:40.030 --> 00:05:41.200
Ieyasu-chan?

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:43.230
Are you a janitor?

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:45.620
Yes.

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:47.320
I am.

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:50.660
Hey, that's...

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:54.750
Um, well...

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:06.560
<i>What was that?</i>

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:07.980
<i>I can't believe that's how</i>

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:10.770
<i>I finally got to meet Ieyasu-chan!</i>

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:12.550
<i>Did she see my face?</i>

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:13.760
<i>Will she remember it?</i>

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:26.100
I-I'm sorry.

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:27.610
Are you okay?

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:33.530
I'm sorry!

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:38.910
Hey, you there!

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.000
I'm with the police.

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:44.090
Did you see a woman come this way?

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:47.300
Hey, she went this way!

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:53.460
Give it to me.

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:56.470
Give me what you had.

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:06.150
Um...

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:08.960
At least let me say in my defense

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:11.750
that I wasn't going to 
do anything bad with it.

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:14.580
That wasn't my intention at all.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.830
Then what were you doing?

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:22.750
Um, I can't expect you to believe me.

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:26.700
But I'm a big fan of yours.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:28.100
And so...

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:29.610
I'm really sorry!

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:30.880
I feel really bad.

00:07:32.690 --> 00:07:35.860
Then you don't have to 
sneak around like this.

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:38.140
Got a second?

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:45.060
There you go.

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:51.170
I may have signed your back,
but cheer for me head on!

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:55.030
Okay! I'll always be a fan of yours!

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:56.080
Do your best!

00:07:57.370 --> 00:08:00.870
Always do my best, huh?

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:03.580
Ieyasu-chan?

00:08:04.070 --> 00:08:06.310
No, it's nothing.

00:08:06.310 --> 00:08:07.880
Ieyasu-chan!

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:11.660
Sorry, they modified the lines a little.

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:14.020
Right, I'm on my way.

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:18.600
Keep cheering me on, okay?

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:20.980
R-Right!

00:08:23.740 --> 00:08:27.730
She was just as I imagined she would be.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:34.010
Oh no, she took my camera...

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:35.530
Huh?

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:39.620
Huh?

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:46.210
Is this?

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:49.210
Hand it over.

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:54.320
The boss says if you hand it over,

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:57.160
he'll pretend the whole 
thing never happened.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:58.880
He's lying.

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:01.130
He's not that kind of person.

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:03.430
You know that.

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:07.750
This is the last time I'll ask.

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:08.770
Give it to me, now.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:23.400
I have to delete the 
data and give it back.

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:25.160
Yes?

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:28.840
Looks like they're postponing 
the shoot for a while.

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:30.660
What for?

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:32.790
Waiting for Sugimura-san, they said.

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:35.130
He's a big shot, after all.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:36.520
I see.

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:39.610
I'll be out for a while;

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:42.320
call me if you need anything.

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:43.660
Okay.

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:44.600
Oh, right.

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:47.270
We got a demo track of your 
new song. Give it a listen.

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.290
You don't get many breaks.

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:53.560
Don't squander them.

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:54.820
Okay.

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:57.310
Make sure you listen and practice it.

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:13.490
Jeez, I was just about to start!

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:15.800
Um...

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:19.480
You again?

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:21.760
Do you have a second?

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:22.600
What?

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:25.650
I want to see what's on that camera.

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:28.810
You still haven't learned your lesson?

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.720
No, that's not it.

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:34.230
I don't understand.

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:36.940
Just leave already!

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.060
It's not like that.

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:40.050
You see, the video on that thing...

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:54.610
Somebody call an ambulance!

00:10:54.610 --> 00:10:55.520
Oh, no!

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:02.260
That red dress...

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:15.260
I took care of her.

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:16.770
<i>Where's the camera?</i>

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:19.820
Well... you see...

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:22.120
<i>Find it!</i>

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:32.830
I heard a woman fell off the roof!

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.100
Suicide?

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:36.460
No, they say maybe murder.

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:39.970
That's her.

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:43.870
This woman ran into me earlier.

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:46.460
Is she the one who fell?

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:51.540
<i>This video is my accusation</i>

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:54.440
<i>against the actor Sugimura Tatsuya.</i>

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:59.730
<i>The man you know as a 
famous actor is nothing more</i>

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:02.820
<i>than a mask to hide his true identity.</i>

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:05.820
<i>His real identity is that 
of a syndicate boss.</i>

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:09.210
<i>He secretly runs an organization</i>

00:12:09.210 --> 00:12:12.330
<i>dedicated to drugs and weapons smuggling.</i>

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:15.920
I can't believe she's talking 
about Sugimura-san...

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:18.090
Then that...

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:23.320
That detective was a fake?

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:24.890
Which means...

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:27.160
Oh, no!

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:28.390
What's wrong?

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:39.580
This is the only exit 
from this room, right?

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:40.290
Yeah.

00:12:41.350 --> 00:12:42.550
Even if they come,

00:12:42.550 --> 00:12:44.460
you can tell them you 
don't know anything, right?

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:47.750
You won a Yellow Ribbon,

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:50.150
so that level of acting should 
be easy for you, shouldn't it?

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:51.250
What do you mean?

00:12:51.840 --> 00:12:53.630
I'm going to give this to the police.

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:56.040
Then I'll go with you.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:57.920
No, it's dangerous.

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:01.520
And I don't want to get my idol involved.

00:13:01.520 --> 00:13:02.880
Your idol...

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:07.220
Take me with you!

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:10.440
I can't do that.

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:21.360
Let's check the next one.

00:13:25.010 --> 00:13:27.440
I really think you should stay.

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:30.030
Take me!

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:30.780
No...

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:32.790
I want to go, no matter what!

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.550
Get on!

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:50.890
<b>Height Limit 2.4M</b>

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:58.430
That's as far as you go.

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:02.290
I knew you had it.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:05.540
Give it to me.

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:07.760
Fine.

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:10.490
But she doesn't have 
anything to do with this.

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:11.830
I do.

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:15.070
I saw the video.

00:14:15.070 --> 00:14:16.290
Ieyasu-chan!

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.290
Just give it to me.

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:21.790
And if I refuse?

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:23.380
I pull this out.

00:14:38.550 --> 00:14:40.610
I can't go on!

00:14:40.610 --> 00:14:44.820
I don't mind dying if it's with you...

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:49.700
Actually, I'd be honored 
if that was my fate.

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:54.510
Come to think of it, 
I never got your name.

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:57.960
Kaoru. Taniyama Kaoru.

00:14:58.230 --> 00:14:59.290
Kaoru-kun...

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:02.650
Humans aren't just slaves to fate.

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:07.470
Sometimes you can master 
your fate, and control it!

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:11.010
Shakespeare said it.

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:25.510
Am I dead now?

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:28.300
It was a short life...

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.960
What a relief...

00:15:34.960 --> 00:15:38.120
Who was it who said they'd 
gladly accept their fate?

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:44.170
That's right.

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:45.920
What's right?

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:52.180
Chosen people like you were 
born with something special.

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:55.150
Not just your talent as an idol.

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:58.680
You seem like you're 
lucky in everything.

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:03.330
Anything you want is 
yours for the taking...

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:04.510
I'm jealous.

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:06.170
Do you think so?

00:16:07.180 --> 00:16:12.000
Lately, no matter what I've 
done, I haven't enjoyed it.

00:16:12.470 --> 00:16:14.010
It's just no fun anymore.

00:16:14.650 --> 00:16:18.590
Maybe that's why I followed you.

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:22.860
I'm starting to think 
that the spotlight isn't

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:24.410
the only place for me.

00:16:24.820 --> 00:16:29.050
That there must be somewhere 
else for me to be.

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:31.680
Are you disappointed?

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:33.610
You look up to me, after all.

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:36.450
No, well...

00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:43.310
Important evidence?

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:48.190
All right. I'll call the 
detective, right away.

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:51.070
Oh, are you...

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:52.800
Chief!

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:54.980
Are you Ieyasu-chan?

00:16:56.260 --> 00:16:58.330
Could you tell?

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:08.840
<b>Justice</b>

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.610
I see.

00:17:00.610 --> 00:17:03.610
I'll make sure this gets 
to the prosecutors.

00:17:03.610 --> 00:17:06.990
And I'll make sure you're kept safe.

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:08.290
Thank you.

00:17:09.110 --> 00:17:11.930
By the way, are you hungry?

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:13.410
A little.

00:17:14.730 --> 00:17:15.840
Just give me a second.

00:17:18.610 --> 00:17:20.620
We're safe now.

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:21.510
Yeah.

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:27.350
Manager

00:17:23.300 --> 00:17:25.090
It's my manager!

00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:27.350
Your TV shoot!

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:30.160
I wonder if she's mad.

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:32.140
You should hurry back.

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:32.990
Yeah.

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:36.040
I'll tell the chief.

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.180
No way.

00:17:41.180 --> 00:17:43.080
They're working together?

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:53.760
Damn it!

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:58.540
And I was going to give 
you a last meal, too.

00:17:58.540 --> 00:18:02.910
Aren't you ashamed, 
working with people like that?!

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:04.380
Not at all.

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:07.900
Your naïve sense of justice 
has no place here.

00:18:08.220 --> 00:18:09.900
Ieyasu-chan.

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:13.070
The role you're about to play

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:16.350
will be much more entertaining 
than the drama

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:18.410
we were slated to co-star in.

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:21.920
At the end of this story,

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:28.170
the Queen of Idols, overcome by
the pressures of her fame,

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:34.330
jumps off the roof with 
a fan she happened to be with.

00:18:34.850 --> 00:18:36.470
It's the end of her life,

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:40.600
both as an idol and a person.

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:42.750
I've never...

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:47.130
I've never wanted to
avoid death so badly before.

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:50.270
Nothing I've done thus 
far has ever worked,

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:52.470
or ever kept going,

00:18:52.470 --> 00:18:54.780
but I feel like I can do 
anything if I try hard enough.

00:18:55.890 --> 00:18:58.780
You just now realized, kid?

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:00.580
Too bad.

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:01.780
It's too late.

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.300
It's not too late.

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:18.520
Manager!

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:25.980
Interpol has kept a close eye 
on you, Sugimura Tatsuya.

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:28.200
An undercover investigation?

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:30.140
That's right.

00:19:36.090 --> 00:19:37.870
What will you do now?

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:39.550
Live as hard as I can.

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:42.740
I might lose hope again,

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:46.620
but I'll try my best to 
find something I want to do.

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:48.920
I know you'll find it.

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:52.060
Maybe I will, too.

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:54.750
Maybe I'll try

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:58.260
being a normal girl, 
not the person I am now.

00:19:59.450 --> 00:20:02.140
Why don't you just do what you want?

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:05.380
I think you should live your own life.

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:07.510
I'll always be your fan.

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:09.480
Yeah!

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:13.740
Take care.

00:20:13.740 --> 00:20:14.770
You, too.

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:32.500
Actually, take me, too!

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:34.790
Okay!

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:47.930
Cut!

00:20:49.050 --> 00:20:50.630
Ieyasu-chan!

00:20:50.630 --> 00:20:52.080
Good work.

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:53.350
That's a wrap.

00:20:53.990 --> 00:20:55.850
Thank you!

00:21:01.100 --> 00:21:04.080
Have you ever wanted 
to stop being an idol,

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:06.450
like the heroine in the movie?

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:08.430
Why do you ask?

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:11.040
Because you've achieved your goal

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:12.410
of becoming a top idol, right?

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:14.740
Nope, not yet.

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:18.700
Like, let's say I'm at the top 
of Mt. Fuji right now, okay?

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:22.380
But Mt. Fuji isn't the only mountain.

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:25.680
There's Everest and Aconcagua!

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:29.090
And once I've climbed all 
the mountains on Earth,

00:21:29.090 --> 00:21:30.610
I'm off to space!

00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:33.000
I'm going to keep on doing my best!

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:34.460
That's good to hear.

00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:37.250
Because I said I'd do it.

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:42.070
I said I'd keep on being a top idol.

00:21:43.260 --> 00:21:46.200
I'm here on Broadway.

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:51.080
Tonight is the first public performance

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:54.330
of the famous former idol, Rosary-san.

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:57.630
It's big news even here in new York.

00:21:58.510 --> 00:22:01.630
The person who makes 
the most people happy

00:22:02.270 --> 00:22:04.380
is the one who does the 
best for themselves.

00:22:05.160 --> 00:22:07.690
So I just have to follow my own path.

00:22:09.500 --> 00:22:10.770
That's right!

00:23:45.960 --> 00:23:47.580
Next, it's my turn:

00:23:47.580 --> 00:23:51.010
The Martial Princess, Imagawa Yoshimoto.

00:23:51.010 --> 00:23:53.410
Next time on Sengoku Collection:

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:55.190
"Martial Princess."

00:23:55.190 --> 00:23:56.880
Just so we're clear,

00:23:56.880 --> 00:23:59.740
I'm not trying to reel you in, okay?
